# MedSync Health, Inc.
## Information Security Risk Assessment
**FY 2024**
**Document ID**: SEC-009
**Classification**: Internal - Confidential
**Last Updated**: December 2024

---

## Executive Summary

MedSync Health completed its annual information security risk assessment in December 2024. The assessment identified 35 risks across 8 categories, with 1 high, 12 medium, and 22 low risks. All high risks have mitigation plans in place, and overall risk posture has improved from prior year.

