## High Risks

### RSK-001: Ransomware/Advanced Persistent Threats

| Attribute | Value |
|-----------|-------|
| Risk ID | RSK-001 |
| Category | External Threats |
| Likelihood | 4 (Likely) |
| Impact | 5 (Critical) |
| Risk Score | 20 (High) |
| Risk Owner | CISO |

**Description**: Healthcare organizations continue to be primary targets for ransomware and APT groups. A successful attack could result in data exfiltration, operational disruption, and regulatory penalties.

**Current Controls**:
- EDR (CrowdStrike) on all endpoints
- Network segmentation and monitoring
- Immutable backups with 4-hour RPO
- 24/7 SOC monitoring
- Incident response plan and retainer

**Mitigation Plan**:
| Action | Target Date | Status |
|--------|-------------|--------|
| Implement EDR on remaining systems | Q1 2025 | In Progress |
| Deploy SOAR for automated response | Q2 2025 | Planned |
| Conduct ransomware tabletop | Q1 2025 | Scheduled |
| Review backup recovery procedures | Q1 2025 | In Progress |

**Residual Risk**: Medium (after mitigations)

