## Risk Appetite

### Risk Appetite Statement

MedSync Health maintains a low risk appetite for:
- Patient data security and privacy
- Regulatory compliance
- System availability

MedSync Health maintains a moderate risk appetite for:
- Product innovation
- Market expansion
- Technology adoption

### Risk Tolerance Thresholds

| Risk Category | Tolerance |
|---------------|-----------|
| Data Breach | Zero tolerance |
| Compliance Violation | Zero tolerance |
| System Downtime | < 4 hours/quarter |
| Security Incidents | < 5/quarter |
| Phishing Success | < 5% click rate |

